## Mechanism notes (tip tree)

- **2.5 / 6.2 full args scan:** after a0/a1/a2 resolved refuse, `c_guard_scan_idents(env, sink, args)` on all sealed sinks (println, write_file, fetch, sys_exec, net, FFI, OS/env).
- **2.7 string/comment FP:** scanner skips `"..."` escapes, `//` line comments, `/* */` block comments before ident spans.
- **2.6 / 5.4–5.6 nested + field/method:** `c_secret_prop_from_rhs` LPAREN recursion; `c_secret_tok_is_sec` field path `__sec__root.f`; method `__fr_secret__` on chain; `c_secret_note_lhs_assign` for bare/field/index LHS.
- **FFI payload path-A:** dlopen path + non-path flag refuse proved; typed `ffi_call` remains residual product hole.

